## Frontend

```bash
cd web && pnpm install && pnpm build
```

`pnpm build`, `pnpm lint` and `pnpm test` run the task in every workspace package through Turborepo, dependencies' builds first. A task whose inputs have not changed is read from the local cache (`web/.turbo/cache`) instead of running again.

The AppHost starts the web app with everything else (`dotnet run --project src/AppHost`).